# The Vercel project "shiftless" has rootDirectory = "global-site", but the CLI
# uploads the whole workspace, not just the root directory. This repo is the
# entire 13-round history — other deploys, data, skills vaults, delivery
# systems — and uploading all of it has been aborting the deploy.
#
# Scope the upload to the one project that actually builds. Everything ignored
# here is either not needed to build shiftless, or is already gitignored
# (.secrets, *.env) and must never leave the machine.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.vercel
**/out
**/dist

.secrets
data
outbox
core
funnel
geo
skills
strategy
deploy
deploy-elder
bounty-hooks
delivery-system
monetization-aggregator
monetization-web-deploy
x402-api
